        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594-a4-a2">

                <pb facs="0577" n="503" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg503"/>

                <head>No. 2.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Ferroll</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-13">13th
                        February</date>–Madrid, 4h. 25m. p. m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Stonewall through with repairs. Niagara getting ready. I am ignorant of the day
                    of departure of the first.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ/</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
